---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | GearPilot AI" description="GearPilot AI has not established a public contact channel. Contact information will be added before public launch." canonicalPath="/contact/" indexable={false}>
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p>GearPilot AI has not published a public contact channel yet. This page is not a contact form and currently cannot receive messages.</p>
  <p>Before accepting visitors for a commercial service, the operator must select a monitored contact method, verify that messages reach an authorized person, define how privacy requests and corrections will be handled, and publish the owner-approved channel here and in the privacy notice. No contact details are published until the operator supplies and tests them.</p>
  <p>This site is currently a demonstration. Do not send sensitive, financial, tax, or identity documents through this site.</p>
</BaseLayout>
